        "Content": "\n***Email Enquiries Only***\n\nWelcome to this beautifully presented four-bedroom semi-detached residence,.\nUpon arrival, a glass-enclosed entrance porch opens into a bright and airy ground floor. The spacious sitting room features a large front window flooding the space with natural light, along with a classic open fire with a feature fireplace surround that creates a warm, cozy focal point. Double glass doors lead through into a generous, fully fitted kitchen complete with ample wooden cabinetry, integrated cooking appliances, a dishwasher, fridge-freezer, and dining area space. Practicality is further enhanced by a convenient downstairs washroom/WC. \nUpstairs, you will find four well-proportioned bedrooms and a contemporary bathroom, fully tiled and equipped with a modern corner shower enclosure and vanity unit. Outside, the property offers off-street driveway parking, a neat front lawn, and attached garage space with a modern roller shutter door. One of the standout highlights of this home is the fantastic, fully enclosed rear garden, offering a private and secure outdoor space.\n\nThe property has been freshly repainted throughout in neutral tones and benefits from brand-new, plush carpets underfoot."
      },
      {
